  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1040372.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">La tarde de este lunes, 1 de junio, ha abierto sus puertas por tercer a&ntilde;o consecutivo la biblioteca infantil de verano en el Raval de Sant Josep, que tendr&aacute; un horario de 17.30 a 20.30 horas, de lunes a viernes. El jueves, adem&aacute;s, estar&aacute; abierta tambi&eacute;n de 10.30 a 13.30 horas. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1040373.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Aparte de sacar libros y devolverlos se organizan igualmente actividades, a cargo de una monitora de M&oacute;n d&#39;Animaci&oacute;.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bibliotecainfantilravalestiu15/p1040369.jpg\" alt=\"p1040369\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bibliotecainfantilravalestiu15/p1040370.jpg\" alt=\"p1040370\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bibliotecainfantilravalestiu15/p1040371.jpg\" alt=\"p1040371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bibliotecainfantilravalestiu15/p1040372.jpg\" alt=\"p1040372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bibliotecainfantilravalestiu15/p1040373.jpg\" alt=\"p1040373\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bibliotecainfantilravalestiu15/p1040374.jpg\" alt=\"p1040374\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bibliotecainfantilravalestiu15/p1040375.jpg\" alt=\"p1040375\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
